  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dustsw_note",
      "title": "Note",
      "rootType": "note",
      "isNote": true,
      "noteText": "Swirling dust particles while the crumble dust plays. ReelArea › Dust Swirl has a group per reel (Dust Swirl 1-5) at the floor, each with three emitters that move differently: Curl and Counter Curl swirl up in opposite curls, Settle kicks dust up that sinks back. Every emitter puffs a random amount and keeps trickling at random, so no two puffs match. The whole board crumbling (Buy, free spin) puffs every reel; winning symbols crumbling puff only the reels they are on, more for more winners."
    },
